{
  "name": "Stripe & Shopify Webhook Idempotency Guard & HMAC Signature Verifier",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Stripe & Shopify Webhook Idempotency Guard (Community Edition)\n\n**Prevents two silent production disasters:**\n1. **Spoofed Webhooks:** Enforces cryptographic HMAC-SHA256 verification with timing-safe comparison and 300s replay-window protection.\n2. **Duplicate Retries:** Deduplicates Stripe/Shopify retry storms via an atomic idempotency key lock before fulfillment runs.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "0042244b-3824-4f67-a430-64b0381f5641",
      "name": "Note: Overview & Threat Model",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -460,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Cryptographic Signature Verification\n\n- **Stripe:** Parses `t=<ts>,v1=<sig>` from `stripe-signature`, validates timestamp skew <= 300s, verifies HMAC-SHA256 hex digest.\n- **Shopify:** Verifies `x-shopify-hmac-sha256` base64 digest against raw body using `crypto.timingSafeEqual`.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "0e1d4ffc-22dd-48c6-bd51-fc31bd7ab995",
      "name": "Note: HMAC Verification Rules",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        40,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Idempotency Store Env Vars\n\nPoint `IDEMPOTENCY_KV_URL` to your Redis REST / Upstash / Supabase endpoint (or Postgres lookup) and set:\n- `STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET`\n- `SHOPIFY_WEBHOOK_SECRET`\n- `FULFILLMENT_WEBHOOK_URL`",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "efdff8bb-c9b1-4873-b511-35e4ab1c982c",
      "name": "Note: Idempotency Store Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        560,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Audit Your Webhook Nodes Automatically\n\nRun our free local zero-trust scanner on any n8n export:\n`npx hooktriage audit my-workflow.json`\n\nNeed prebuilt Redis/Postgres idempotency adapters & 1-click `--fix`?\nUnlock the **Production Hardening Kit ($27)** at:\nhttps://hooktriage.com",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "9ac357c8-4158-4bad-9328-da2a776d1425",
      "name": "Note: HookTriage CLI & Hardening Kit",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1060,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "payment-webhook-guard",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {
          "rawBody": true
        }
      },
      "id": "1bb2c516-4ef1-44dc-933d-aa0e1c0d860d",
      "name": "Receive Payment Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -420,
        180
      ],
      "webhookId": "db2682b3-70d8-42a0-850c-d7595ac5cca0"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "d7dfb82d-ba47-454e-bd27-af9e53217413",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.headers[\"stripe-signature\"] || \"\" }}",
                    "rightValue": "",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "notEmpty"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "outputKey": "stripe"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "09a011a1-7d0e-44d3-9fea-eb407599d5b2",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.headers[\"x-shopify-hmac-sha256\"] || \"\" }}",
                    "rightValue": "",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "notEmpty"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "outputKey": "shopify"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "3e20d445-7b26-44b5-b9c2-5495acc089a8",
      "name": "Detect Provider",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [
        -180,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const crypto = require('crypto');\nconst item = $input.first().json;\nconst sigHeader = item.headers?.['stripe-signature'] || '';\nconst secret = $env.STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET || 'whsec_demo_placeholder';\nconst parts = Object.fromEntries(sigHeader.split(',').map(p => p.split('=')));\nconst ts = Number(parts.t || 0);\nconst raw = typeof item.body === 'string' ? item.body : JSON.stringify(item.body || {});\nconst expected = crypto.createHmac('sha256', secret).update(`${ts}.${raw}`).digest('hex');\nconst skewOk = Math.abs(Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000) - ts) <= 300;\nconst valid = Boolean(parts.v1 && skewOk && parts.v1.length === expected.length && crypto.timingSafeEqual(Buffer.from(parts.v1), Buffer.from(expected)));\nreturn [{ json: { provider: 'stripe', signature_valid: valid, event_id: item.body?.id || 'evt_unknown', event_type: item.body?.type || 'unknown', payload: item.body || {} } }];"
      },
      "id": "20baf8cc-10de-4fbe-a074-f4a204ddc653",
      "name": "Verify Stripe HMAC-SHA256",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        80,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const crypto = require('crypto');\nconst item = $input.first().json;\nconst hmac = item.headers?.['x-shopify-hmac-sha256'] || '';\nconst secret = $env.SHOPIFY_WEBHOOK_SECRET || 'shopify_demo_placeholder';\nconst raw = typeof item.body === 'string' ? item.body : JSON.stringify(item.body || {});\nconst expected = crypto.createHmac('sha256', secret).update(raw, 'utf8').digest('base64');\nconst valid = Boolean(hmac && hmac.length === expected.length && crypto.timingSafeEqual(Buffer.from(hmac), Buffer.from(expected)));\nreturn [{ json: { provider: 'shopify', signature_valid: valid, event_id: item.headers?.['x-shopify-webhook-id'] || String(item.body?.id || 'shp_unknown'), event_type: item.headers?.['x-shopify-topic'] || 'orders/paid', payload: item.body || {} } }];"
      },
      "id": "3eed254b-cbbd-449c-a8f0-06ccc4e71390",
      "name": "Verify Shopify HMAC-SHA256",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        80,
        280
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "append"
      },
